   "en": "{07 0e 00}What{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Oh, are you talking\nabout hide-and-seek? \n{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 03 00}Ha ha ha!{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 06 00}{0b 03 00}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}! You're serious!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 16 00}Oh wow, sorry!{01 00 00 05 00} The time ran\nout so long ago...\nI thought we had already\nquit, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{01 01 00}\n{07 0f 00}I'm really sorry{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.",
   "et": "{07 0e 00}Mida{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Oh, kas sa räägid\npeitusest? \n{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{07 03 00}Hah hah hah!{01 00 00 05 00}\n{07 06 00}{0b 03 00}{01 00 00 05 00}{04 1f 00}! Sa oled tõsine!{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{07 16 00}Oh vau, vabandust!{01 00 00 05 00} Aeg sai\nammu otsa...\nMa arvasin, et me olime\njuba lõpetanud, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!{01 01 00}\n{07 0f 00}Mul on tõesti kahju{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}.{01 00 00 03 00}."
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
